    "The Seven-Day Dopamine Reset is a non-negotiable operational protocol governed by The Rule of Absolute Elimination. For seven full calendar days (one hundred and sixty-eight hours), you must enforce complete abstinence from The Big Five Super-Stimuli: Short-Form Video Algorithms, Digital Video Games, Internet Pornography, Refined Sugars and Junk Food, and Passive Information Consumption.",
